  "content": {
    "id": "p3-q5-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "5",
    "prompt": "Solve each double inequation. Write your answers using bracket interval notation.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p3-q5-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$-4<-2x<8$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$(-4,2)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-4&<-2x<8\\\\2&>x>-4\\\\-4&<x<2\\end{align*}$$\nDividing by $-2$ reverses both inequality signs. Both endpoints are excluded, so the interval is $(-4,2)$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p3-q5-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$-2\\le -x\\le 1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$[-1,2]$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-2&\\le -x\\le 1\\\\2&\\ge x\\ge -1\\\\-1&\\le x\\le 2\\end{align*}$$\nDividing by $-1$ reverses both inequality signs. Both endpoints are included, so the interval is $[-1,2]$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p3-q5-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$-7\\le 5-3x<4$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\left(\\frac13,4\\right]$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-7&\\le 5-3x<4\\\\-12&\\le -3x<-1\\\\4&\\ge x>\\frac13\\\\\\frac13&<x\\le 4\\end{align*}$$\nDividing by $-3$ reverses both inequality signs. The interval is $\\left(\\frac13,4\\right]$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 32
      },
      {
        "id": "p3-q5-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$-4<1-\\frac13x\\le 3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$[-6,15)$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}-4&<1-\\frac13x\\le 3\\\\-5&<-\\frac13x\\le 2\\\\15&>x\\ge -6\\\\-6&\\le x<15\\end{align*}$$\nMultiplying by $-3$ reverses both inequality signs. The interval is $[-6,15)$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      }
    ]
  },
